  DUT      : swi_d (AT-x960-56YSQ) console u2 at 115200, S/N A2WQS700B, standalone,
             Active Master, software sin_x96056-20261019-27
  stimulus : the DUT writes a log message for every CLI command it is given. A command
             that carries a unique text string is therefore a log message on demand,
             at notice level, with known text.
  tools    : tools/ckcon.py, tools/cfg.py (console driving);
             tools/awshell.py (a `start-shell` root shell on the DUT, used read-only in
             this case, to name the media and to count entries in the log files);
             tools/ckreload.py (reload); tools/health.py (health reads)

STEP 0 -- the permanent log before anything was changed                         done
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
awplus# show log config
    Permanent log:
      Status ......... enabled
